{
  "ID": "38989",
  "post_title": "'Catxirulos' y paellas en el lunes festivo del barrio del Castillo, en Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-07-15 20:12:42",
  "post_name": "catxirulos-y-paellas-en-el-lunes-festivo-del-barrio-del-castillo-en-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La pista polideportiva del barrio del Castillo, en Onda, ha acogido este lunes el 4&ordm; campeonato nacional de &#39;Catxirulos&#39; hechos a mano, dentro de sus fiestas, y despu&eacute;s el concurso de paellas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_7468.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La competici&oacute;n de cometas estaba patrocinada por FUTBOL SALA ONDA y a los ganadores se les ha obsequiado con cheques regalo de ropa deportiva.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_7456.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En el concurso de&nbsp;paellas hab&iacute;a premios a la mejor presencia, mejor sabor y m&aacute;s original.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7434.jpg\" alt=\"img_7434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7435.jpg\" alt=\"img_7435\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7436.jpg\" alt=\"img_7436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7437.jpg\" alt=\"img_7437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7438.jpg\" alt=\"img_7438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7439.jpg\" alt=\"img_7439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/catxirulospaellabarricastell/img_7440.jpg\" alt=\"img_7440\" style=